["spell:8227"]={
["lines"]={{
["source"]="Summons a Flametongue Totem with {1} health at the feet of the caster. The totem enchants all party or raid members' main-hand weapons with fire if they are within {2} yards. Each hit causes {3} to {4} additional Fire damage, based on the speed of the weapon. Slower weapons cause more fire damage per swing. Lasts {5} min.",
