["lines"]={{
["source"]="Places a spell on the target that heals them for ({1} + {2}% of healing power) the next time they take damage or receive non-periodic healing. When the heal occurs, Prayer of Mending jumps to a party or raid member within {3} yards. Jumps up to {4} times and lasts {5} sec after each jump. This spell can only be placed on one target at a time per caster.",
