["talent-spell:426316:1"]={
["lines"]={{
["source"]="Hitting an enemy with Conflagrate increases all Shadow damage you deal by {1}% for {2} sec, and hitting an enemy with Shadowburn increases all Fire damage you deal by {3}% for {4} sec. In addition, Conflagrate has a {5}% chance not to consume Immolate, and Shadowburn has a {6}% chance to instantly refund a Soul Shard.",
